(INC-1105)\n- **Service:** payment-service · **Environment:** production\n- **Severity:** high · **Confidence:** 89%\n- **Affected services:** payment-service, order-service, user-service, inventory-service\n\n## Summary\n\nPayments are slow because Redis is down: the redis deployment was scaled to 0 at 14:48Z. Every service falls back to the database, so latency rose about 9× across services, although requests still succeed.\n\n## Root cause\n\nRedis outage (deployment scaled to 0) forces every service to fall back to the database, increasing latency across services. _(confidence 89%)_\n\n### Supporting evidence\n\n- `ev-s5-metrics-1` (metric, prometheus): Cache DOWN: redis_up dropped to 0 at 14:48Z [link](http://localhost:3000/d/service-overview/service-overview?var-service=payment-service&from=1790519700000&to=1790521500000&viewPanel=Redis)\n- `ev-s5-k8s-1` (k8s_event, kubernetes): ScalingReplicaSet: deployment redis scaled to 0 at 14:48Z [link](http://localhost:3000/d/k8s-workloads/k8s-workloads?var-deployment=redis&from=1790519700000&to=1790521500000)\n- `ev-s5-logs-1` (log, elasticsearch): 312 Redis ECONNREFUSED errors with database fallback since 14:48Z [link](http://localhost:5601/app/discover#/?_g=(time:(from:'2026-09-27T14:35:00Z',to:'2026-09-27T15:05:00Z'))&_a=(index:'payment-prod-*',query:(language:kuery,query:'FROM%20*-prod-*%20%7C%20WHERE%20message%20LIKE%20%22Redis%20connection%20error*%22')))\n- `ev-s5-alerts-1` (alert, alertmanager): RedisDown (critical) firing since 14:49Z [link](http://localhost:9093/#/alerts?filter=%7Balertname%3D%22RedisDown%22%7D)\n- `ev-s5-metrics-2` (metric, prometheus): payment-service p95 0.15 s → 1.4 s (all services slower) [link](http://localhost:3000/d/service-overview/service-overview?var-service=payment-service&from=1790519700000&to=1790521500000&viewPanel=Latency%20p95)\n\n## Impact\n\np95 latency 1.4 s (≈9×) on payment-service and higher latency on all services since 14:48Z; no errors.\n\n## Timeline (UTC)\n\n- 14:48:00 redis scaled to 0 replicas _(k8s)_\n- 14:48:05 First ECONNREFUSED; services fall back to the DB _(logs)_\n- 14:49:00 RedisDown fires _(alerts)_\n- 14:50:00 Latency up on all services _(metrics)_\n\n## Next steps\n\n1. Scale redis back to 1 replica.\n2. Find out who scaled it down (audit log) and why.\n\n## Open questions\n\n- Who scaled redis to 0?\n\n_Generated by AI Incident Agents (demo mode)._"},"clarification_question":null,"versions":{"model":"fake-llm (replay)","prompts":"v1","dataset":"demo-1"},"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"calls":8},"duration_ms":31800,"created_at":"2026-09-27T15:05:00Z","completed_at":"2026-09-27T15:05:31.800Z","mode":"demo"},"events":[{"type":"investigation_started","investigation_id":"inv-demo-s5","timestamp":"2026-09-27T15:05:00.000Z","seq":1,"agent":null,"data":{"question":"Payments are slow in production"}},{"type":"plan_created","investigation_id":"inv-demo-s5","timestamp":"2026-09-27T15:05:01.200Z","seq":2,"agent":null,"data":{"context":{"question":"Payments are slow in production","service":"payment-service","environment":"production","time_range":{"start":"2026-09-27T14:35:00Z","end":"2026-09-27T15:05:00Z"},"symptoms":["cache_connection_errors","latency_up"]},"steps":[{"id":"st-s5-logs-r1","agent":"logs","objective":"Find new error patterns for payment-service","round":1,"depends_on":[],"status":"queued","started_at":null,"finished_at":null},{"id":"st-s5-metrics-r1","agent":"metrics","objective":"Check latency, errors and cache health","round":1,"depends_on":[],"status":"queued","started_at":null,"finished_at":null},{"id":"st-s5-alerts-r1","agent":"alerts","objective":"List firing alerts","round":1,"depends_on":[],"status":"queued","started_at":null,"finished_at":null},{"id":"st-s5-k8s-r1","agent":"k8s","objective":"Check workloads and dependencies","round":1,"depends_on":[],"status":"queued","started_at":null,"finished_at":null},{"id":"st-s5-code-r1","agent":"code","objective":"Find recent changes","round":1,"d